  "description": "Han-Ju is your ordinary university student… except for the fact that she’s also the up-and-coming Metube cover artist, PLII. When popular boy group member Levi takes notice of PLII and requests to collaborate, Han-Ju will do anything to hide her secret identity. But as the two grow closer working on a class project, Han-Ju’s cover begins to unravel. Will Levi discover her secret? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)\n\n*Note: Includes 10 extra chapters.*",
